10
00:07:31,740 --> 00:07:33,760
我们玩的是 Minecraft Auto

11
00:07:34,100 --> 00:07:35,980
Minecraft Auto 6

12
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:37,100
干杯

13
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:43,380
